  "hard_rules": [
    "normalized typed facts are the only correctness input",
    "no second parser or raw source fallback",
    "repository addon path and popularity are never semantic conditions",
    "packs are declarative non executable bounded and versioned",
    "recognizer outputs are Derived or Possible only",
    "all competing matches remain visible",
    "native frame events registry frame-event bridges custom callbacks and CVar callbacks remain distinct",
    "custom EventRegistry callback requires exact TriggerEvent producer for confirmed custom relation",
    "hook recognition never claims taint combat protected managed forbidden or runtime safety",
    "SavedVariables roots require exact TOC declarations",
    "negative clauses require complete closed-scope coverage",
    "recognizers emit proposals and never publish graph state or final IDs",
    "rule versions own atomically replaceable producer partitions",
    "rule removal reduces coverage only",
    "truncated partial failed or cancelled output is never complete",
    "mutation evaluation must detect repository path and name overfitting",
    "no filesystem network process editor database client or LLM correctness path"
  ],
